(Exercises both dwell-marker colours: G4 uses colors['dwell'] and a)
(user-defined M1xx call uses colors['m1xx'], so a bake of this program)
(must collect exactly two palette entries and give each marker the index)
(of its own colour. The two dwells either side of the M100 also pin that)
(a colour recurring after another one reuses its original entry rather)
(than taking a new one.)
(Free of tool changes and tool-length offsets: the standalone gcode)
(module has no tool table, so T/M6 and G43 cannot be parsed headlessly.)
